{
  "title": "Dashboard checker results",
  "uid": "dashboard-checker-results",
  "description": "Results of grafana-dashboard-checker scans, from its Loki log lines. Set Stream to the stream the checker pushes to: {job=\"<LOKI_JOB_LABEL>\"}.",
  "tags": [
    "dashboard-checker"
  ],
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "",
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Event reference",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "icon": "doc",
      "url": "https://github.com/grafana/grafana-dashboard-checker/blob/main/docs/reference.md#scheduled-mode-checker_modeonce"
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Loki",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "loki",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "stream",
        "label": "Stream",
        "type": "textbox",
        "description": "The Loki stream selector for the checker's logs. Scheduled mode pushes with job set to LOKI_JOB_LABEL (default dashboard-checker); in continuous mode, use whatever labels your log shipper adds.",
        "query": "{job=\"dashboard-checker\"}",
        "current": {
          "text": "{job=\"dashboard-checker\"}",
          "value": "{job=\"dashboard-checker\"}"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "{job=\"dashboard-checker\"}",
            "value": "{job=\"dashboard-checker\"}"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 🩺 Dashboard checker results\n\nThis dashboard shows results from **[grafana-dashboard-checker](https://github.com/grafana/grafana-dashboard-checker)**, a tool that automatically finds broken dashboards on any Grafana instance. Use it to see the latest scan, which panels are broken, how results trend over time, and which dashboards need attention.\n\n👉 Source and setup: [github.com/grafana/grafana-dashboard-checker](https://github.com/grafana/grafana-dashboard-checker)",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Latest scan",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latest scan",
      "description": "The newest scan in the time range, all its shards added up (grouped by scan_id). Broken: dashboards with a panel showing Grafana's red error icon. Failed to load: the page never loaded. Incomplete: only partly checked (time limit, or an error part-way; empty before the checker had per-dashboard time limits). Still loading: a panel was still loading at the settle cap. Unchecked: not reached before the scan ran out of time.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "$stream | json | event=\"scan_complete\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "maxLines": 5000
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "extractFields",
          "options": {
            "source": "Line",
            "format": "json",
            "replace": false,
            "keepTime": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "groupBy",
          "options": {
            "fields": {
              "scan_id": {
                "aggregations": [],
                "operation": "groupby"
              },
              "Time": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "max"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "dashboards_total": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "dashboards_broken": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "panels_red": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "dashboards_load_failed": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "dashboards_incomplete": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "dashboards_unsettled": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              },
              "dashboards_unchecked": {
                "aggregations": [
                  "sum"
                ],
                "operation": "aggregate"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "Time (max)": "Time",
              "dashboards_total (sum)": "Dashboards",
              "dashboards_broken (sum)": "Broken",
              "panels_red (sum)": "Red panels",
              "dashboards_load_failed (sum)": "Failed to load",
              "dashboards_incomplete (sum)": "Incomplete",
              "dashboards_unsettled (sum)": "Still loading",
              "dashboards_unchecked (sum)": "Unchecked"
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "scan_id": 0,
              "Time (max)": 1,
              "dashboards_total (sum)": 2,
              "dashboards_broken (sum)": 3,
              "panels_red (sum)": 4,
              "dashboards_load_failed (sum)": 5,
              "dashboards_incomplete (sum)": 6,
              "dashboards_unsettled (sum)": 7,
              "dashboards_unchecked (sum)": 8
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "convertFieldType",
          "options": {
            "fields": {},
            "conversions": [
              {
                "targetField": "Time",
                "destinationType": "time"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": {
            "sort": [
              {
                "field": "Time",
                "desc": true
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "limit",
          "options": {
            "limitField": 1
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Broken"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Red panels"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "red",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Failed to load"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Incomplete"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Still loading"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "yellow",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Unchecked"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "color": "green",
                      "value": null
                    },
                    {
                      "color": "orange",
                      "value": 1
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "vertical",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 19,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Failed scans (in time range)",
      "description": "Scans in the time range that couldn't run or finish (scan_failed): Grafana unreachable or too old, k6 crashed, or no panels recognised. See Scan problems below.",
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time($stream | json | event=\"scan_failed\" [$__range]))",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 19,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 5,
        "h": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
